From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Sheludko <ishell@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:59:43 +0100
Subject: [ic] Fix handling of detached globals

Invalidate the JSGlobalObject's prototype validity cell in
Isolate::DetachGlobal so pre-existing LoadGlobalIC/StoreGlobalIC
prototype handlers are invalidated when the global proxy is detached.
Also bail out to the slow stub in LoadGlobalIC/StoreGlobalIC when the
JSGlobalObject is detached and the lookup is not an own data property,
so non-PropertyCell handlers that pass the rebound JSGlobalProxy as
receiver without access checks are not installed.

Fixed: 575524702

